<article class="env-lemma" id="0AVJ">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0AVJ">Lemma <span data-tag="0AVJ">15.71.7</span>.</a> Let $(R, \mathfrak m, \kappa )$ be a local Noetherian ring. Let $K \in D^+(R)$ have finite cohomology modules. Then the following are equivalent </p>
  <p><ol>
  <li><p>
$K$ has finite injective dimension, and 
</p>
</li><li><p>
$\mathop{\mathrm{Ext}}\nolimits ^ i_ R(\kappa , K) = 0$ for $i \gg 0$. 
</p>
</li>
</ol></p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      This is a special case of Lemma <a href="/tag/0DW2" data-tag="0DW2">15.71.6</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>